== Effects ==
* Spawns a {{m|Beggar}} near Isaac.
** The beggar can sometimes be a {{m|Devil Beggar}} and rarely a {{m|Key Master}}, {{m|Bomb Bum}}, {{m|Battery Bum}}, or {{m|Rotten Beggar}} instead.

== Notes ==
* The probabilities for each type of beggar to spawn are as follows:
** If Rotten Beggar is unlocked:
*** 61.50% {{m|Beggar}}
*** 33.33% {{m|Devil Beggar}}
*** 1.33% {{m|Battery Bum}}
*** 1.31% {{m|Rotten Beggar}}
*** 1.28% {{m|Key Master}}
*** 1.24% {{m|Bomb Bum}}
** If Rotten Beggar is not unlocked:
*** 62.75% {{m|Beggar}}
*** 33.33% {{m|Devil Beggar}}
*** 1.33% {{m|Battery Bum}}
*** 1.31% {{m|Key Master}}
*** 1.28% {{m|Bomb Bum}}

== Strategy ==
* Even if Isaac is short on pickups to give to the beggars, they can still be blown up for more pickups and increased {{r|Devil Room}} / {{r|Angel Room}} chance.
** To save on bombs, it is recommended to use '''XX - Judgement''' near a [[tinted rock]] or a {{r|Secret Room}}'s entrance, so that they can both be blown up by the same bomb.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: Spawns two beggars. Each beggar can be any of type.
** {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}} + {{i|Blank Card}}: Only spawns one beggar when used with blank card.

